      "b": "The praise of the Founders does appear earlier in the speech, but it is a concession that sets up the turn — it does not deliver the critique itself.",
      "c": "Anaphora drives the 'What to the slave…' sequence, but the strategy of undercutting the celebration is carried by the blunt answer — 'a sham' — not the repetition.",
